  "id": "purposeful-behavior",
  "term": "purposeful behavior",
  "definition": "Purposeful behavior is behavior that appears to be directed toward a goal or purpose. In the context of compulsions, it refers to repetitive acts that seem purposeful even though the person generally recognizes them as senseless, does not find them pleasurable, and may do them to relieve tension.",
